le":"Add TaskType enum","messageBody":"Task type icons are defined separately in each task subclass\n\nKeeping the icons in Todo, Deadline, and Event spreads one fixed set of task\ntypes across multiple classes.\n\nIntroduce a TaskType enum to represent each supported task category.\n\nThis keeps the task type and its display icon together in one place, while\nletting each subclass simply pass its category to Task.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":8,"deletions":20}}},{"hash":"64f54b84535f1338ae0c6f4df30afd8e8a4d5bf0","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add TaskType.java","messageBody":"","tags":["A-Enums"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":28,"deletions":0}}}]},{"date":"2026-08-26T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"a24e7b06eb9c94ca6f074e69488123f7bc08cff3","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add task writing to file","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"txt":{"insertions":1,"deletions":0},"java":{"insertions":52,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"7ef045aa59ab1d73778a6c75e7ce181c85671f82","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add reading task from file","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"txt":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1},"java":{"insertions":89,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"8a6bb25c0ac4b6770701902fed1c0fef960eaa8d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add error handling for files","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":240,"deletions":39}}},{"hash":"db8e0d22f1801cbf095d512d75536c9747d914a8","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-Level-7\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["Level-7"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"3799281e56ef3ad51bb4a5e38cc434739c730c24","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add deadline dates","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":100,"deletions":18}}},{"hash":"dcd90fc69a86355b1431c7849cc31835436b343c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Sort list by date","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":23,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"31bab967274f6b239000d5fb2f8b431214ab9381","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add format hints for invalid dated task commands","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":18,"deletions":6}}},{"hash":"d1f79c33f1d955fc4efa9967e2841fc206025895","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-Level-8\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["Level-8"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"e298f7f3e8dae1108f6ca05b4818ac3feb626060","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract task persistence into Storage","messageBody":"Move file loading, task reconstruction, storage escaping, and atomic save logic out of DowntownGurl into a dedicated Storage class. This gives the main class a smaller responsibility while preserving the existing command behavior and save rollback paths.\n\nKeep corrupted saved-line reporting available to DowntownGurl via Storage so the UI can still tell the user which saved tasks were skipped during startup.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":295,"deletions":237}}}]},{"date":"2026-08-27T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"7a94fb8725ee4a94dc199c80d3b819e930af85c2","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract user interaction into Ui","messageBody":"Move greeting, command input, task-list display, confirmations, goodbye, and error output from DowntownGurl into a dedicated Ui class. This keeps DowntownGurl focused on application flow while preserving the existing user-facing text and command behavior.\n\nLeave task-list sorting inside Ui for this iteration because it was coupled to list display before the refactor. A later TaskList extraction can move that ordering behavior to the task-list abstraction.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":149,"deletions":100}}},{"hash":"038b4c1706d1c3e719c5b3d6328ca8a525742272","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract task collection into TaskList","messageBody":"Introduce a TaskList class to own the ArrayList of tasks and common list operations such as add, delete, mark, unmark, size, lookup, and date sorting. This removes raw ArrayList manipulation from DowntownGurl and gives the task collection a clearer home before extracting parser logic.\n\nUpdate Ui to display a TaskList and update Storage to save any iterable collection of tasks, preserving the existing save rollback behavior and user-facing command output.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":134,"deletions":32}}},{"hash":"fe863b75b30be5163303a9f134222d683cd58212","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract command parsing into Parser","messageBody":"Move command recognition, task-number validation, and Todo/Deadline/Event creation from DowntownGurl into a dedicated Parser class. Parser now converts raw user input into a small Command object that DowntownGurl can execute.\n\nAdd CommandType and Command to keep parsing separate from command execution without rewriting the whole application flow in the same increment. This preserves existing user-facing command behavior while making DowntownGurl more focused on orchestration.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":251,"deletions":137}}},{"hash":"a764b0ca8decdcf02b64320cb4434d31ae41c0f6","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Make DowntownGurl own app dependencies","messageBody":"Convert DowntownGurl from a mostly static script into an application object with Storage, TaskList, Ui, and Parser fields. main now simply creates the app with the configured task file and calls run, matching the target OOP structure more closely.\n\nKeep task loading inside run after the welcome message so existing startup output order and corrupted-line warnings remain unchanged.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":57,"deletions":45}}},{"hash":"cdf370ecfeeccc77439fa8dcf9097f5f588943f9","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Move command execution into command classes","messageBody":"Turn Command into an executable abstraction and add concrete command implementations for bye, list, mark, unmark, delete, and add. Each command now owns the task-list mutation, storage save, rollback, and UI confirmation that belongs to that action.\n\nSimplify DowntownGurl so the run loop only reads input, asks Parser for a Command, executes it, and handles errors. Remove CommandType because command behavior is now polymorphic instead of switched in the main class.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":148,"deletions":156}}},{"hash":"7dc440d0f13e3f9a073d815739ad3c8009bc7fd4","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Align run loop with command architecture","messageBody":"Reshape DowntownGurl.run to follow the course-style flow: read the full command, show a divider, parse with Parser.parse, execute the Command, then ask the command whether it exits. This keeps the main loop readable while preserving command-owned execution.\n\nMove divider ownership to Ui.showLine and remove per-response divider printing so the loop controls interaction boundaries consistently. Task-number bounds are now checked during command execution because Parser no longer depends on TaskList.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":60,"deletions":36}}},{"hash":"205d49a40032f40f954b036d01870c7729d66822","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027A-MoreOOP\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["A-MoreOOP"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"438bdc17738d670c66bfaf095b1919d2dc947e4c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Organize classes into Java packages","messageBody":"Move the application into a downtowngurl base package with command, parser, storage, task, ui, and exception subpackages. Split concrete command classes into separate files so they can be imported cleanly after packaging, and update the README entry-point path.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":296,"deletions":194},"md":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"a0678c3da2b3ef030a81ff79ab2112bb0cda22da","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-A-Packages\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["A-Packages"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"eac93fbbee23ea097a6dffd92ecee6f964e4d19b","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027add-gradle-support\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["A-Gradle"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-08-28T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"20e98c05b0ebcfbd26a20de98083740cf1ee878b","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add JUnit tests for TaskDateTimeTest","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":89,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"ed43a8aca6e88a7fffa41a3a938c626a50825b98","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add targeted JUnit coverage for core task flows","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":287,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"68e67dd0d5536ccbc8189844dcec0e81badc9052","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update AI documentation on test coverage target","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"md":{"insertions":5,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"d76c0d5461f98853e0853254d74062ec58066dbe","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-A-JUnit\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["A-JUnit"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"3431ec4e95d70b8d91ecb98a535fb217f4335dff","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Configure Shadow JAR packaging for DowntownGurl","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"gradle":{"insertions":2,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"ebb4e5ec52fff725712a79ac1d087cefc6f7a596","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-A-Jar\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["A-Jar"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"4d0dc98329912d6003941d8f055e8eeb5df7ffaf","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add JavaDoc comments","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":244,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"3022c6c3ec8c67c8f9047a3572b9f3e224b95945","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"